dialect protocol
protocol stdio.docx.mutations
version 1
schema stdio.docx
start record

# FG-wave: REAL binary op frame (`format u8 | tag u8 | variant payload`), replacing F6's
# `print_op().into_bytes()` text-as-binary shortcut (`../../🦀️.rs`'s old
# `OpBinary::encode_op`/`decode_op`). `tag` is the `DocxMutation` variant ordinal, in the SAME 0-11
# order `encode_op`'s own match uses (`NoMutation` dropped, EVERY ordinal renumbered 0-based:
# `SetSnapshot`=0, `InsertBlock`=1, `RemoveBlock`=2, `SetBlockContent`=3, `SetRunText`=4,
# `SetRunFormatting`=5, `InsertStyle`=6, `RemoveStyle`=7, `SetStyleName`=8, `SetStyleBasedOn`=9,
# `SetPart`=10, `RemovePart`=11) -- both REAL fixed fields, individually protocol-walked, matching
# `📰xml/…/🧬️mutations/💾️binary/📡️.protocol.semio`'s own `format`/`tag` header shape.
#
# Past that header, the variant's own payload is one opaque trailing `bytes` chain: several
# variants (`InsertBlock`/`SetBlockContent`'s `block: DocxBlock`, `SetSnapshot`'s whole
# `DocxSnapshot`, `InsertStyle`'s `style: DocxStyle`) carry the SAME genuinely recursive/
# data-carrying payloads `../🔺️diff/💾️binary/📡️.protocol.semio` already hits
# (`protocol-prim-ref-recursion`, `📖️grammar-recipe.md` §5) -- once ANY variant's payload is
# structurally unwalkable, bundling every variant's payload into the SAME opaque tail (rather than
# partially structuring only the simpler, flat-field variants) is the honest, minimal-surface
# choice, same reasoning `../🔺️diff/💾️binary/📡️.protocol.semio`'s own doc comment gives.
#
# The Rust `encode_op`/`decode_op` side stays genuinely, fully structured past this header -- real
# LEB128-varint-framed `DocxBlockPath`/collection encoders and recursive per-variant binary
# sub-encoders (`enc_block_path_bin`/`enc_docx_snapshot_bin`/`enc_opc_package_bin`/
# `enc_docx_document_bin`, `../../🦀️.rs`'s own `OpBinaryCodec` region), reusing this
# artifact's `../🔺️diff/🦀️.rs` `pub(crate)` binary primitives
# (`write_str_lp`/`write_bytes_lp`/`enc_block_bin`/`enc_style_bin`/`enc_opc_part_bin`/
# `enc_rel_bin`/`enc_target_mode_bin`) rather than re-deriving them a second time -- round-trip
# tested independently of this protocol description, same honest-boundary treatment
# `📖️grammar-recipe.md` §2.5 documents.
framing record
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8
chain payload bytes
